  data: {
    LLM: '1. Draw from stock or discard. 2. Meld sets (3+ same rank, same or mixed suits) and runs (3+ in suit). Aces/Kings can form sets across suits. 3. Discard one. 4. If from discard, must meld immediately. 5. Conditions: melds with 3s, 5s, 7s (valle) or runs ending in K or starting with A pay chips. 6. First to meld 11 wins the hand.',
    Player: '1. Draw from stock or discard. 2. Meld sets (3+ same rank, same or mixed suits) and runs (3+ in suit). Aces/Kings can form sets across suits. 3. Discard one. 4. If from discard, must meld immediately. 5. Conditions: melds with 3s, 5s, 7s (valle) or runs ending in K or starting with A pay chips. 6. First to meld 11 wins the hand.',
    objective: 'Be first to meld 11 cards (10 hand + 1 draw). Conditions (valle cards, sequences to/from K or A) pay chips from other players immediately.',
    gameplay: '1. Draw from stock or discard. 2. Meld sets (3+ same rank, same or mixed suits) and runs (3+ in suit). Aces/Kings can form sets across suits. 3. Discard one. 4. If from discard, must meld immediately. 5. Conditions: melds with 3s, 5s, 7s (valle) or runs ending in K or starting with A pay chips. 6. First to meld 11 wins the hand.',
    keyRules: [
